    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ef3d88ca7efdb7876dd6462",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以说我希望大家多多了解风水！　然后，我希望大家\n都快乐！　懂得风水，就可以避开不幸招来幸福！",
      "source_fingerprint": "42fddfaa7c7d1bf0225a6ced4a319e469c4f65a58061008e0ece27707ff5627f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1af431492777b67d6a6395d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那，历奇是为了大家……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cbf628a07ff95931b8ff17ae1d38d28914fdcf3e21e9c04628700c33e11a6a8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eacbefc059c08504b8bb5f51",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小林历奇",
      "source_fingerprint": "5062acb0b4a86a5620c916b5619b61f071134305d2ea0a4b3346ce3d45cdc803",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
