    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22b397b3107c45301f9e07fe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过关键是我输掉了，我的说服力也就变弱了。\n没想到在那么重要的比赛上，我听不到大地的声音。",
      "source_fingerprint": "218f84e48d3ba20d7e9d0f76e5e8045ca52bf90ddf4214d4375d428cefb70570",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:765e95d78f0120ebb93b6824",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那个“大地的声音”是指？",
      "source_fingerprint": "34f16d66ec746150ff926e407db58cf0ed304f10d49bc863778fb6ba36332619",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cc3951e37c63a1f886dbe14",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小林历奇有纯粹的“想要帮助别人”的想法。\n这点令我很佩服，但我突然很在意一件事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0f241ab9bd7f670f733b10688386127bab0e207bc880ec6a0ee4db074e9ea88",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c940d16d141465dbd14639b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小林历奇",
      "source_fingerprint": "5062acb0b4a86a5620c916b5619b61f071134305d2ea0a4b3346ce3d45cdc803",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098003.json",
