    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:912106d190e08aa558b36bda",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大地的声音？　啊，虽说是称作声音，但并不是真的\n能听到声音，只是我自己有那样的感觉而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e482af7123534361da5905382f61d8fcdb681937837876bd84b8aca7d221621d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:628845fdf73b8c73d5be4a24",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是因为北港火山说的那些话吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "aad7f71e2d05014e0766dfc1ac69bb8dd03523bd5cbbd212ca40212ad83610dc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
