    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:879a1cf670cf240cf7297788",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我还是个小学生的时候，就能听到“大地的声音”了。\n在运动会的赛跑上，注意力集中于比赛时――",
      "source_fingerprint": "48d81c17290afa0f208d1ee93bb60e859277fdafde94097dc53f7793867915fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098003.json",
      "json_path": [
