      "source_text": "即使闭着眼――我也能清楚地看到整个海滩。\n听得到大地的声音，十分清晰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8532704c095f7e889ce064344729f0a908b4e2ff46cc9a21859fcc11270f8101",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "text"
