    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c8d8aa7efbda116a496bc1f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小林历奇",
      "source_fingerprint": "5062acb0b4a86a5620c916b5619b61f071134305d2ea0a4b3346ce3d45cdc803",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        46,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/46/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e93350693eb63ab3373cd70",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯ー，状态极佳啊。并不是我失去了感知能力。\n但那场选拔赛的时候，为什么我听不到声音呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c264495afd9c4bbc61d8c0cde3045b4e9c0f2311b81b769d6da5bd883d3788b8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        46,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/46/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e08d19aad7b4ecf55338354f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我开始思考。如果不是因为状态的话……在这“海边”能够\n听到声音，而在“赛场”上则听不到的原因是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2086c2597a446286bd09d1baf63229677df17c6d6a97d89aafe8d3e9ef96e1a9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        47,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/47/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95e6abb62307d72f7515ff17",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小林历奇说，她小时候在运动会上屡战屡胜。\n在“学校的操场”上，她也确实听到了声音……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a6473d05325a105fb288ad8c768d677bac877bc65b37e50548a768d324879c6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f81ef852e3801b9593b81541",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“学校的操场”“海边”能听见，\n在“赛场”听不见。在其中――",
      "source_fingerprint": "48a0b90fbd37578c9f836357052f0d7e1ab43cb63482a6a9fc1aa60a98fc5df2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        49,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/49/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1cb46843e763d8d8dbf5329",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小林历奇",
      "source_fingerprint": "5062acb0b4a86a5620c916b5619b61f071134305d2ea0a4b3346ce3d45cdc803",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a70cacc5f7d9e4b442d34c3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我每天都有在做这样的训练☆　因为风水不是用来\n实现愿望的。它是去告诉你努力的方向！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a28b6c7e6c1418603ab8ebccbbc006a76827d8f8e1a83b42f07627d99958de23",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b3f725fb4708ca91a3beb2a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果明显存在风水环境的差异的话――",
      "source_fingerprint": "667d838440e7e3483a114f840d5ebd4670e5bb648e84d83aad663a343a8fb392",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        50,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83f86d48a83dcc9e7180efa0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我或许……知道了",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a162a0567c4bb4b7b0e5cf6321edc73d494a44418a5d6c0654102df4d8c51bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098003.json",
      "json_path": [
