      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9dd9860dbe3b7db0ea1fca9f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果我的预想正确的话，\n小林历奇她――",
      "source_fingerprint": "e37cb7863325efafd2f02e9426f6677cb9c043345600c762133b3587ba5a3297",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        54,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/54/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb605ce901b9bef15fc7bb45",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在接下来的选拔赛中一定能展现出实力了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01d8a582185fb45d0372315f7a27a5f04627155037f67c18b0e5af970a6aaa9c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1098/storytimeline_041098003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        55,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/55/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4d13013dfd4ce74a4a88ade",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――努力的方向。从这句话我可以看出，\n小林历奇并不是一名完全依赖于风水的马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7e17f62599a0e88ea97a384f939d752d32390c75f3690ef524aa67c753b6082",
